    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i want to get more specific with their look and vibe though. if the empire is very pale and orderly, i want the antagonists to feel more... visceral. like, maybe their skin tones or physical features reflect that 'wild' and 'untamed' nature you mentioned. can you describe what a typical warrior from this tribe would look like? i want them to look distinctly non-human/exotic so the readers immediately feel that 'otherness' and sense that they belong to a more primal part of the world.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
