      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Their skin could be deeply pigmented, perhaps marbled with ochre or iridescent blues reflecting minerals from their wild habitats. Instead of armor, they might wear intricately woven hides adorned with bone carvings, featuring asymmetrical or unsettling patterns. To evoke a non-human quality, consider subtle biological adaptations, like elongated limbs, natural keratinous ridges along their forearms, or eyes that reflect a predatory, otherworldly luminescence. This visceral look immediately establishes them as an embodiment of the untamed wilds.",
