      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds really striking. i like the idea of them being very physically different. to really drive home the theme of 'civilization vs savagery,' can you expand on their social structure and behavior? i want them to feel less like a structured society and more like a collection of instinct-driven people. how do they treat their leaders or their laws? i'm thinking something much more brutal and tribal compared to the empire's laws.",
